; selftest-declined.eval - handed to the runner by `Eval.ps1 -SelfTest`; must
; FAIL, with refused= counting every declined line below and nothing else.
;
; A SETUP line that is declined must fail the run (code-review C442): these used
; to decline with a Print, so a script carried on and measured a world it never
; built. Each line here asks for a change the world refuses.
logecho on
reset
worldprops start 0 0
state
